# needs typographic-palette.scm: the typographic palette of the "Color" menu
# (pal), its list of sets opened (sets), and the set "Earth" chosen in it:
# the grid is made again with the colours of the set, the menu stays open
# (earth), and the choice is kept in the preference "typographic palette set"
wait 7000
window Palette
snapshot pal
click 110 10
wait 800
snapshot sets
click 60 64
wait 800
move 120 160
wait 800
snapshot earth
